{"id":"shiken-vs-migishiken","order":1110,"title":{"ja":"四間飛車対右四間飛車：▲８六角と▲６四角の受け方","en":"Fourth File Rook vs Right Fourth File Rook: the ▲8六角 and ▲6四角 defence"},"path":["戦法・定跡","四間飛車"],"intro":{"ja":"右四間飛車は、飛車・角・銀・桂を一点に集める攻撃的な戦法です。受ける四間飛車の側は、早めに▲５六銀と上がり、▲９八香を用意して備えます。△８五桂の仕掛けには▲８六角とかわし、△６五歩は囲いの組み具合で取り方を変えます。片美濃、美濃、高美濃の三つの場合を、初手から順に追って覚えます。","en":"Right Fourth File Rook gathers rook, bishop, silver and knight on a single point. The defending Fourth File Rook player prepares with an early ▲5六銀 and ▲9八香. Against the △8五桂 strike, dodge with ▲8六角, and answer △6五歩 differently depending on how far the castle is built. This lesson follows the three cases of Kata Mino, Mino and Taka Mino from move one."},"check":{"question":{"ja":"右四間飛車の△８五桂に対して、７七の角をどこへかわしますか。","en":"Against the Right Fourth File Rook strike △8五桂, where does the bishop on 7g go?"},"answer":{"ja":"▲８六角です。この角は桂に当たりを避けながら、のちに▲６四角と走る筋も残せます。▲９五角や▲８八角もありますが、▲８六角が最も応用の利く形です。","en":"▲8六角. It escapes the knight's attack and keeps the later ▲6四角 run available. ▲9五角 and ▲8八角 are possible too, but ▲8六角 is the most flexible."}},"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車 vs 右四間飛車の定跡 (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/1699, All rights reserved)","references":[{"title":"四間飛車 vs 右四間飛車の定跡","url":"https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/1699","license":"All rights reserved","adapted":false}],"courses":[{"id":"lesson-shiken-vs-migishiken-1","title":"四間飛車対右四間飛車：▲８六角と▲６四角の受け方: 右四間飛車に備えた基本図","titleEn":"Fourth File Rook vs Right Fourth File Rook: the ▲8六角 and ▲6四角 defence: The basic position prepared for Right Fourth File Rook","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車 vs 右四間飛車の定跡 (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/1699, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"ここで先手は▲５八金とせずに、▲４六歩と突きます。金を５八へ寄せる手は、仕掛けの時期を見てぎりぎりまで保留します。後手が△７三桂と跳ねたら、▲９八香と上げます。この香車の意味は次の章でわかります。後手は△８五桂といつでも仕掛けられる態勢です。\n覚える点は三つです。早めに▲５六銀と上げておく。▲９八香と上がっておく。▲５八金は相手の出方を見て、保留しておく。この三つがあれば、右四間飛車の攻めにも落ち着いて対応できます。","root":{"id":"n0","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n1","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n2","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n3","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n4","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2h6h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n5","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7c7d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n6","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p2ppp1pp/1pp3p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8h7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n7","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p2ppp1pp/1pp3p2/9/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6c6d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n8","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p3pp1pp/1ppp2p2/9/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7i7h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n9","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p3pp1pp/1ppp2p2/9/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR5/LN1GKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7a6b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n10","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r1s3b1/p3pp1pp/1ppp2p2/9/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR5/LN1GKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7h6g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n11","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r1s3b1/p3pp1pp/1ppp2p2/9/2PP5/PPBSPPPPP/3R5/LN1GKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6b6c","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n12","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r5b1/p2spp1pp/1ppp2p2/9/2PP5/PPBSPPPPP/3R5/LN1GKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g5f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n13","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r5b1/p2spp1pp/1ppp2p2/9/2PPS4/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LN1GKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6c5d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n14","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl