てぎりぎりまで保留します。後手が△７三桂と跳ねたら、▲９八香と上げます。この香車の意味は次の章でわかります。後手は△８五桂といつでも仕掛けられる態勢です。\n覚える点は三つです。早めに▲５六銀と上げておく。▲９八香と上がっておく。▲５八金は相手の出方を見て、保留しておく。この三つがあれば、右四間飛車の攻めにも落ち着いて対応できます。","commentEn":"Sente leaves ▲5八金 alone and plays ▲4六歩. Moving the gold to 5h is kept in reserve as long as possible, depending on Gote's timing. When Gote jumps △7三桂, Sente plays ▲9八香; the point of this lance move appears in the next chapter. Gote can strike with △8五桂 at any moment.\nRemember three things: raise ▲5六銀 early, play ▲9八香, and keep ▲5八金 in reserve until Gote shows its plan. With these three, Sente can answer Right Fourth File Rook's attack calmly.","figures":[{"id":"1-4","marks":{"last":"9h","boxes":["9h","5f"]}},{"id":"1-5","marks":{"boxes":["5f","9h","5h"]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"後手は飛車を６筋へ振ります。飛車を居飛車の側から数えて四筋目に回すので、右四間飛車と呼ばれます。先手は玉を２八へ運んで片美濃囲いに組み、後手は舟囲いに玉を入れました。","commentEn":"Gote swings the rook to the sixth file. It is the fourth file counted from Gote's right, hence the name Right Fourth File Rook. Sente walks the king to 2h for a Kata Mino and Gote shelters the king in a Funa-gakoi.","figures":[{"id":"1-3","marks":{"last":"1f","boxes":["6b","2h"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"先手は▲７七角から、銀を７八、６七と上げ、▲５六銀まで進めます。右四間飛車の攻めは６五の一点に集まるので、５六の銀が早くから６五に利きを足す役目をします。後手は６筋の歩を突いて銀を５四へ運び、攻めの形を作りました。","commentEn":"Sente plays ▲7七角 and brings the silver via 7h and 6g to ▲5六銀. Right Fourth File Rook's attack converges on 6e, and the silver on 5f adds protection to that square early. Gote pushes the sixth-file pawn and brings the silver to 5d to form the attack.","figures":[{"id":"1-2","marks":{"last":"5f","boxes":["6e","5f"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"ここまでは四間飛車のいつもの出だしです。▲７六歩で角道を開け、▲６六歩で止め、▲６八飛と振ります。後手は飛車先の歩を突かず、７筋と３筋を進めて右四間飛車を目指す構えを見せています。","commentEn":"The usual Fourth File Rook opening: ▲7六歩 opens the bishop, ▲6六歩 stops it and ▲6八飛 swings the rook. Gote does not push the rook pawn and instead advances on the seventh and third files, showing the intent of Right Fourth File Rook.","figures":[{"id":"1-1","marks":{"last":"6h","boxes":["6f"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}},{"id":"lesson-shiken-vs-migishiken-2","title":"四間飛車対右四間飛車：▲８六角と▲６四角の受け方: 片美濃で受ける：△６五歩には▲同歩","titleEn":"Fourth File Rook vs Right Fourth File Rook: the ▲8六角 and ▲6四角 defence: Kata Mino: answer △6五歩 with ▲同歩","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車 vs 右四間飛車の定跡 (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/1699, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"後手には有効な攻めがなく、△５五銀と△同馬の交換で続けるしかありません。そこで先手は▲６四角と飛び出します。右四間飛車を受けるとき、この▲６四角は常に有力な手です。後手の飛車をにらみ、先手がよくなりました。","root":{"id":"n28","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n29","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n30","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n31","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n32","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2h6h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n33","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7c7d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n34","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p2ppp1pp/1pp3p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8h7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n35","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p2ppp1pp/1pp3p2/9/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6c6d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n36","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p3pp1pp/1ppp2p2/9/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7i7h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n37","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p3pp1pp/1ppp2p2/9/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR5/LN1GKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7a6b","kind":