1/1pp3p1p/3P5/1BP2P2P/PP+n1P1PP1/L4RSK1/3G1G1NL w 2SPn 1","branches":[{"usi":"6b6e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n73","sfen":"l4gsnl/4g1kb1/p3pp1p1/1pp3p1p/3r5/1BP2P2P/PP+n1P1PP1/L4RSK1/3G1G1NL b 2SPnp 1","branches":[],"comment":"▲同桂△同桂成▲４八飛△６五飛と進むと、駒割は銀桂の交換で先手の駒得です。ところが後手の飛車は金に当たり、こちらの飛車は狭い場所に押し込められ、先手の劣勢になります。銀を渡さないように指すのがこの章のポイントです。","commentEn":"▲同桂 △同桂成 ▲4八飛 △6五飛 leaves Sente ahead by silver for knight on material. But Gote's rook threatens a gold while Sente's rook is cramped, so Sente is worse. Not handing over a silver is the point of this chapter.","figures":[{"id":"2-v1-2","marks":{"last":"6e","boxes":["6e","4h"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"銀と歩を交換したあとで、△７七銀と打たれます。この銀が飛車と角の両方に当たり、後手の攻めは止まりません。","commentEn":"After the silver and pawn exchange Gote drops △7七銀. It attacks both rook and bishop, and Gote's attack cannot be stopped.","figures":[{"id":"2-v1-1","marks":{"last":"7g","arrows":["7g6h"]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"△６五歩を▲同銀と取る変化です。銀が捌けてよいように見えますが、実は先手が悪くなります。後手に銀を渡すのが問題です。","commentEn":"Here Sente captures △6五歩 with the silver. It seems to free the silver, but it actually worsens Sente's position; giving Gote a silver is the problem.","figures":[{"id":"2-v1"}]}}],"comment":"▲８六角とかわします。▲９五角や▲８八角でも受かりますが、▲８六角は一番応用が利く形です。後手は続けて△６五歩と突き、追撃してきました。この歩を▲同歩と取るか、▲同銀と取るかが分かれ目です。","commentEn":"Dodge with ▲8六角. ▲9五角 and ▲8八角 also hold, but ▲8六角 is the most flexible. Gote follows up with △6五歩. Whether to capture with the pawn or the silver is the dividing point.","figures":[{"id":"2-3","marks":{"last":"6e","arrows":["6e6f"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"△８五桂が仕掛けです。桂が７七の角に当たりました。角をどこへかわすかが問題です。","commentEn":"△8五桂 is the strike. The knight attacks the bishop on 7g, so the question is where the bishop goes.","figures":[{"id":"2-2","marks":{"last":"8e","arrows":["8e7g"]}}]}}],"comment":"基本図です。後手が先に仕掛けてきた場合、片美濃のままで受ける形を見ます。","commentEn":"The basic position. First see how Sente meets an early strike with the Kata Mino as it is.","figures":[{"id":"2-1","marks":{"boxes":["7c","6b"]}}]}}]}}]}