 2Sn2p 1","branches":[{"usi":"4g5f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n162","sfen":"l4g1nl/4g1s2/p3pp1k1/1pp3ppp/3r5/1BPbGPP1P/PP+n1P2P1/L4RSK1/5G1NL w 2Sn2p 1","branches":[],"comment":"△同角と歩を取る変化です。▲５六金と上がれば、飛車と角の両取りになります。４七に金がいる高美濃の形だから指せる手で、これが高美濃の強みです。","commentEn":"Gote may take the pawn with the bishop. ▲5六金 then forks rook and bishop. The move is possible because the gold stands on 4g in the Taka Mino, which is that castle's strength.","figures":[{"id":"4-v2"}]}}]}}],"comment":"後手は△６五飛と飛車を走らせました。ここで焦点の歩の▲６六歩が決め手です。焦点の歩とは、敵の駒が複数利いている地点に打つ歩のことです。６六には後手の飛車と角が利いていますが、どちらが取っても先手に返す手があります。","commentEn":"Gote runs the rook with △6五飛. The decisive reply is the focal-point pawn ▲6六歩, a pawn dropped on a square several enemy pieces reach. Gote's rook and bishop both reach 6f, but whichever captures, Sente has a reply.","figures":[{"id":"4-6","marks":{"last":"6f","arrows":["6e6f","2b6f"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"飛車と角の両取りなので、先に▲７七桂と銀を取って応じます。△同桂成に対しては、▲４八飛と飛車を安全な場所へ逃がします。８六の角は成桂に当たり続けています。","commentEn":"It is a double attack, so Sente answers by taking the silver first with ▲7七桂. After △同桂成, ▲4八飛 moves the rook to safety. The bishop on 8f keeps attacking the promoted knight.","figures":[{"id":"4-5","marks":{"last":"4h","boxes":["4h"]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"高美濃まで組んでいるときは、▲同銀が正解です。銀を交換して、後手が急所の△７七銀を打ってきます。飛車角両取りですが、これで先手がうまくいく筋があります。","commentEn":"With Taka Mino built, ▲同銀 is the right capture. After the silver exchange Gote drops the key △7七銀. It forks rook and bishop, but Sente has a way through.","figures":[{"id":"4-4","marks":{"last":"7g","arrows":["7g6h"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"▲８六角と△６五歩。ここまでは同じ展開です。同歩でよいのでしょうか。","commentEn":"▲8六角 △6五歩. Same sequence so far. Is capturing with the pawn still right?","figures":[{"id":"4-3","marks":{"last":"6e","arrows":["6e6f"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"先手は▲５八金から▲４七金と上がり、▲３六歩と突いて高美濃になりました。後手は玉を２三へ寄せて天守閣美濃に組み、△３二銀と固めます。そのタイミングで後手が△８五桂と仕掛けました。","commentEn":"Sente goes ▲5八金 and ▲4七金, then ▲3六歩, reaching Taka Mino. Gote moves the king to 2c for a Tenshukaku Mino and firms up with △3二銀. At that moment Gote strikes with △8五桂.","figures":[{"id":"4-2","marks":{"last":"8e","boxes":["4g","2c"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"三度目の基本図です。今度はお互いに囲いを固め合い、先手が高美濃まで組んだ場合を見ます。","commentEn":"The basic position once more. This time both sides finish their castles and Sente builds a Taka Mino.","figures":[{"id":"4-1","marks":{"boxes":["4g","5h"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}},{"id":"lesson-shiken-vs-migishiken-5","title":"四間飛車対右四間飛車：▲８六角と▲６四角の受け方: 龍を捕まえる変化","titleEn":"Fourth File Rook vs Right Fourth File Rook: the ▲8六角 and ▲6四角 defence: Trapping the dragon","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車 vs 右四間飛車の定跡 (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/1699, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"▲７八銀と打ち、龍が△９八龍と香を取ったところで▲８七銀と打ちます。△９七龍と逃げると▲８九桂で、龍の逃げ道がふさがりました。銀と龍の交換に持ち込めます。ただし先手は手順中に香を取られ、持ち駒をすべて自陣に使うので、必ず良くなる変化ではなく、互角といえます。級位者同士の将棋では飛車を持つ側が勝ちやすいので、覚えておいて損はありません。","root":{"id":"n163","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n164","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n165","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n166","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n167","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2h6h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n168","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7c7d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n169","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p2ppp1pp/1pp3p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branche